✔ auth: ordinary valid sign-up, invalid request and read-only request still behave as before (4260.8673ms)
✔ wardrobe and photo uploads: auth and quota run before the read, a timeout answers 408 before any write, and ordinary requests are unchanged (5543.0947ms)
