✔ deferred BEGIN fails read-to-write upgrade at once; BEGIN IMMEDIATE does not (605.3167ms)
✔ auth dialect: eager IMMEDIATE transaction, async bounded lock acquisition, gate released on every exit (2155.7902ms)
